post_install() {
    cat <<'EOF'
==> DX RUST needs your own copy of Deus Ex: Game of the Year Edition.
==> With Steam, just install it; Proton fetches the files DX RUST reads and
==> you don't have to run it. For GOG or anything else, click
==> "Game Folder..." in the launcher.
==> The first start copies the game programs to ~/.local/share/dx-rust/
==> and runs them from there; that copy is refreshed after each upgrade.
==> For Steam's Game Mode, add /usr/bin/dx-rust as a Non-Steam Game.
EOF
}
